## User

Split a list into chunks of the given size; the last chunk may be shorter.

## Type

type
```haskell
chunksOf :: Int -> [a] -> [[a]]
```

## Term

```haskell
chunksOf n xs = go n xs []
  where
    go _ [] acc = [acc]
    go 0 xs acc = acc : go 0 xs []
    go n xs acc = go (n - 1) xs $ take n xs : acc
```

